// Editor test (Script Test project): script API v18. A test game finds the scene's entities by name and
// checks names, the hierarchy, renaming, Destroy, Enabled (a parent takes its child), tint, shadows,
// material and visibility, transforms (position, local position, rotation), a cached Ref and a spawned
// mesh, on the HUD; the rows as drawn are checked during Play, and Stop puts every one back.
